0,Maithili music - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maithili_music,"Maithili Music is one of the most ancient types of music in the Indian subcontinent. It originated from Mithila, a geographical and cultural region of the Indian subcontinent bounded by the Mahananda River in the east, the Ganges in the south, the Gandaki River in the west and by the foothills of the Himalayas in the north. [1][2] It comprises certain parts of Bihar and Jharkhand of India [3 ...",Maithili,Indo-European
1,Maithili language - Wikipedia,https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Maithili_language,"Maithili (Tirhuta: 𑒧𑒻𑒟𑒱𑒪𑒲, / ˈmaɪtɪli / MY-til-ee, [8] Maithili: [ˈməi̯tʰɪliː]) is an Indo-Aryan language spoken in parts of India and Nepal. It is native to the Mithila region, which encompasses parts of the eastern Indian states of Bihar and Jharkhand as well as Nepal's Koshi and Madhesh Provinces.",Maithili,Indo-European
2,MAITHILI - YouTube Music,https://music.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLOED5fBJqGbO31R8ncnNssHFbBnKgcjkX,"Listen to MAITHILI on YouTube Music - a dedicated music app with official songs, music videos, remixes, covers, and more.",Maithili,Indo-European
3,Maithili Melodies Across Eras | Udit Narayan Songs - YouTube,https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7WaL_IoUuh4,"Spanning from the captivating tunes of the 1970s to the heart-rending melodies of the 2010s, these songs mark milestones in Maithili music's history.",Maithili,Indo-European
4,Maithili Thakur Live concert on Sep 25 at BabylonCinema Berlin.,https://indoeuropean.eu/maithili-thakur-live-concert-on-sep-25-at-babyloncinema-berlin/,"Indo German Filmweek & Films in collaboration with ICCR in Germany - Indisches Kulturzentrum, TTC is organizing a live concert by celebrity Classical & Folk Music Singer from India, Ms. Maithili Thakur on Sep 25 at #BabylonCinema Berlin.",Maithili,Indo-European
5,Maithili Songs - playlist by Raman Jha | Spotify,https://open.spotify.com/playlist/34OOB09GkoeUL7ELVgfEjI,Playlist · Maithili Songs · 121 items · 3.5K saves Preview of Spotify Sign up to get unlimited songs and podcasts with occasional ads. No credit card needed.,Maithili,Indo-European
6,Maithili Music - Melodigging,https://www.melodigging.com/genre/maithili-music,"Maithili music is an ancient musical tradition from Mithila, a historical region that today spans northern Bihar and Jharkhand in India and the eastern Terai of Nepal. Sung in the Maithili language, it encompasses devotional, seasonal, and life‑cycle repertoires performed at births (Sohar), weddings (Vivah‑geet), harvests, and festivals such as Chhath and Sama‑Chakeva.",Maithili,Indo-European
7,Maithili Thakur - Journey of a Classical and Folk Music Prodigy ...,https://www.sarabibi.com/2025/04/maithili-thakur-journey-of-classical.html,"Introduction Maithili Thakur is a talented Indian playback singer known for her soulful renditions of classical and folk music. With training in Hindustani classical traditions and a deep-rooted passion for regional music, she has captured the hearts of audiences across India. Her rise to fame through reality singing competitions and her growing digital presence have solidified her place as a ...",Maithili,Indo-European
8,Maithili Thakur is the multilingual prodigy taking Indian folk music ...,https://www.abc.net.au/asia/maithili-thakur/104676684,"Maithili Thakur - India's musical prodigy who's making the nation proud. From Bihar's rich cultural roots to performing on global stages, she's bringing Indian folk and classical music to ...",Maithili,Indo-European
9,Folk Music of Mithila - Mithila lifestyle and culture,https://mithilalifestyleandculture.design.blog/2020/12/11/mithila-music/,"Maithili music is very much traditional . Maithili Music is usually played by classical instruments, but now use of modern instruments is making these folksongs more appreciable. From those times there are several contributers who has been giving their whole lives to music. Vidyapati was the patron of music and literature of Mithila.",Maithili,Indo-European
